<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE-KLENE H1 NET PROFIT RISES.</title>
<headline>TABLE-KLENE H1 NET PROFIT RISES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     1.4  vs   1.3</p>
<p>    Turnover				27.8  vs  27.5</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 2.2  vs   2.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Sweets maker Klene Holding NV said it expected</p>
<p>pressure on profit margins in the second half of 1997, due to</p>
<p>overcapacity among market players. The company expected the</p>
<p>full-year profit to be slightly higher than 1996's 2.2 million</p>
<p>guilders. Klene previously said it saw sales and profits rising</p>
<p>in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
